# Nix build output
result
result-*

# Content-borne version stamp — only ever written into a stamped SOURCE
# copy inside the Nix store at offline-image bake time (nix/offline-inputs.nix).
# Must never exist in the working tree: its presence makes flake.nix's version
# block bypass the git-metadata read, which is exactly wrong for a dev build.
.nixblitz-version-stamp

